<title>FRANCE: New York top origin for ADP imports '96.</title>
<headline>New York top origin for ADP imports '96.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Paris airports authority, the Aeroports de Paris (ADP), said New York was the top airport gateway for imports to Charles de Gaulle and Orly Airports last month.</p>
<p>The top ten airport gateways  for ADP imports in December 1996 in tonne and the percentage change on December 1995 were:</p>
<p>				Dec 1996   Percent change</p>
<p>  1.  New York		3,353     down  14.9</p>
<p>  2.  Chicago		 2,481	 up  19.9</p>
<p>  3.  Tokyo		   1,833     down  21.8</p>
<p>  4.  Hong Kong	     1,646	 up   3.8</p>
<p>  5.  Montreal		1,641	 up   5.3</p>
<p>  6.  Los Angeles	   1,326     down  10.1</p>
<p>  7.  Singapore		 855     down  94.6</p>
<p>  8.  Miami		     729	 up   8.3</p>
<p>  9.  Seoul		     668	 up  48.1</p>
<p> 10.  Casablanca		 586     down  29.1)</p>
<p>-- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
